      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="updated">Last updated: [Month, Year — update this whenever you edit the policy]</p>

      <p>This policy explains what information SmartCheck ("we," "us") collects when you visit [yourdomain.com], and how it's used.</p>

      <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>We don't require you to create an account or hand over personal information to browse this site. We may automatically collect standard technical data like your browser type, device type, and pages visited, through analytics tools such as Google Analytics.</p>

      <h2>Cookies and Advertising</h2>
      <p>This site uses Google AdSense to display ads. Google and its partners use cookies to serve ads based on your prior visits to this site or other sites on the internet. You can opt out of personalized advertising by visiting <a href="https://adssettings.google.com" target="_blank">Google Ads Settings</a> or <a href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices" target="_blank">aboutads.info</a>.</p>

      <h2>Affiliate Disclosure</h2>
      <p>SmartCheck is a participant in the Amazon Services LLC Associates Program, an affiliate advertising program designed to provide a means for sites to earn advertising fees by linking to Amazon.com. As an Amazon Associate, we earn from qualifying purchases. This comes at no extra cost to you.</p>

      <h2>Children's Privacy</h2>
      <p>This site is not directed at children under 13, and we do not knowingly collect personal information from children.</p>

      <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p>We may update this policy from time to time. Changes will be posted on this page with an updated date.</p>

      <h2>Contact Us</h2>
      <p>Questions about this policy? <a href="/contact">Contact us</a>.</p>

